      "**Nursing focus:** repeat ECGs, serial troponins, chest pain/diaphoresis/dyspnea, rhythm, vitals, aspirin/anticoagulant contraindications, IV access, oxygen only if hypoxemic, and rapid escalation for instability or STEMI changes.",
